{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42626","headline":"赠和龙妙空禅师 · 王继勳","name":"赠和龙妙空禅师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白面山南灵庆院，茅斋道者雪峰禅。\n只栖云树两三亩，不下烟萝四五年。\n猨鸟认声呼唤易，龙神降伏住持坚。\n谁知今日秋江畔，独步医王阐法筵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王继勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42626.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42626","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}